  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile settings (config_002, 005) and scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_005) significantly improve performance over singleprofile and PCA. This experiment tests whether replacing avgpool (used in config_005) with transformer aggregation further enhances performance, isolating the impact of aggregation method. It builds on the strong evidence for scvi_n200 while exploring a critical design choice (representation vs aggregation) without introducing image modalities or fusion, maintaining focus on RNA-only improvements."
}

